# DEEPSEEK_API_KEY_SARIN_BOT (o DEEPSEEK_API_KEY), RESEND_API_KEY y REMOVE_BG_API_KEY se administran en
# Google Cloud Secret Manager mediante Firebase Functions:
#   firebase functions:secrets:set <KEY>

